# Free-form text style controls (Oct 2026)

## What landed

Authorable **fontSize** / **weight** / **align** for free-form leaves that draw text. Shared editor UI → JSON props → server `DocContext.label` → canvas `NodeView` preview.

| Component | Props | Defaults (when unset) |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `text` | fontSize, weight, align (+ lines, marquee, color) | Title 16 / Regular 400 / start |
| `clock` | fontSize, weight, align, color, show | Display 44 / Light 300 / start |
| `countdown` | fontSize, weight, align, color, text | Display 44 / Light 300 / **center** |
| `markdown` | fontSize, align, color, text | Body 14 / start; bold/italic still from `**` / `*` per line |
| `button` | fontSize, weight (+ text, icon, color, ink) | Body 14 / Medium 500 (no align) |
| `badge` | fontSize, weight (+ text, icon, color) | Body 14 / Medium 500 (no align) |

**No `fontFamily`** — Remote Compose `scope.Text` in `Widgets.kt` has size + weight only; tablets use the platform default typeface.

## Wiring

```
AttributesPanel → TypographyFields.vue
  → node.props fontSize | weight | align
  → NodeView.vue (CSS fontSize / fontWeight / textAlign)
  → FreeFormNodes / FreeFormMedia → label(..., sp, ink, weight, align)
```

- **Presets** in `TypographyFields`: Caption 12, Body 14, Title 16, Headline 22, Value 28, Display 44, Huge 96 — match `Type` in `Widgets.kt`.
- **Weights**: 300 / 400 / 500 / **600** (`Weight.SEMI_BOLD`) / 700.
- Prop docs: `Node` KDoc in `Layout.kt`.

## Gotchas

- Countdown align default is **center** (preserve old look); UI uses `default-align="center"`. Do not treat missing `align` as start for countdown.
- Button/badge had hard-coded `Type.BODY` + `Weight.MEDIUM` — keep those as defaults when props are absent.
- Clock weight default stays **Light** so existing clocks do not jump to Regular.
- Markdown: do not add a global weight control; line weight comes from markdown markers.
- Preview: `.t-button` / `.t-badge` must not hard-code font-size/weight in CSS — set from props on the root style (same as `text`).

## Out of scope

- Custom typefaces / Google Fonts on tablets.
- Editor chrome typography tokens (panels, toolbars).
- Grid tile title sizes (fixed tile renderers).

## Verify

```bash
./gradlew :server:detekt :server:test \
  --tests 'tech.shaffersoftworks.remotescreens.server.render.FreeFormTest'
cd editor && npm run lint
```

In the editor: Text / Clock / Button / Badge / Markdown / Countdown → change size + Bold → canvas updates immediately.
